 8713+834E              ; data_available_in_module_file:
 8714+834E              ; NZ/NC = HL available data (clamped to download_length).
 8715+834E              ; Z/NC = closed socket with no queued bytes; Z/C = user pressed B.
 8716+834E              ; Temporary emptiness is paced and retried, never treated as EOF.
 8717+834E              ; Empty polls wait until data, confirmed closure or B; AT query replies remain bounded.
 8718+834E              ; Changes AF/BC/DE/HL. Directory polling above keeps its own completion policy.
 8719+834E              data_available_in_module_file
